  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pumpin 4 The Man**: back after 85 archived shows (1496 days); rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **I Saw Gener Cryin In His Sleep**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2011-12-29.mimna.bsc1-k3.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 31 songs; 151 min [1]. Said about its sound: This is a hi-resolution 24-bit 48kHz file set not meant for CD; a 16-bit 44.1kHz version with MP3s also exists [1]\n- **ween2011-12-29.mimna.bsc1-k3.flac16**: source not stated; 31 songs; 151 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2011-12-29.mimna.bsc1-k3.flac24**: taped by Jim Mimna; source: Busman Audio BSC1-K3> Grace Lunatec V3 > Busman Hybrid R4 @24/48 [1]. Also: Transfer chain: Busman Hybrid R4 via USB, then WaveLab6, CD Wave Editor, Traders Little Helper, and Foobar; captured at 24-bit 48kHz [1]\n- **ween2011-12-29.mimna.bsc1-k3.flac16**: taped by Jim Mimna; source: Busman Audio BSC1-K3> Grace Lunatec V3 > Busman Hybrid R4 @24/48 [2]. Also: Transfer chain: Hybrid R4 via USB, WaveLab 6 for edits and mixing, CD Wave Editor, TLH verified and leveled at 8, then Foobar [2]",
